    "sentence_translations": [
      "China is Pretty Good",
      "",
      "One day, Little Le asked Paul: “Paul, what did you think of China the first time you came here?”",
      "",
      "Paul thought for a bit and said: “I think China is beautiful. But you said that the Chinese are modest, but I don't think so.”",
      "",
      "Little Le asked: “Why not?”",
      "",
      "Paul said: “Because everywhere in the streets I see the writings: ‘Chinese people are pretty good’, ..",
      ".. ‘Chinese construction is pretty good’, and a lot of places say ‘China is pretty good’.”",
      "",
      "Little Le laughed loudly and said: “Paul, those two characters are not ‘pretty good’, it's ‘bank’”",
      "“So the above-mentioned say ‘People's Bank of China’, ‘China Construction Bank’ and ‘Bank of China’.”"
    ]
  }
